Training method:
After inputting the user-configured file in Yaml_Nmae=["xxxxxx"] in the train.py file, run the following command in the terminal: python train.py

Testing method:
After inputting the user-configured file in File_Name_File="xxxxxxx" in the test.py file, run the following command in the terminal: python test.py

Dataset format is as follows:
image
  train:
    xxx.img
  test:
    xxx.img
  val:
    xxx.img
  labels:
    xxx.txt

image_ir
  train:
    xxx.img
  test:
    xxx.img
  val:
